.TH MLH-IBUS 1 "2026-10-29" "mlh 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mlh-ibus \- modeless Japanese input method for IBus
.SH DESCRIPTION
The IBus daemon starts mlh-ibus when the mlh input source is selected.
Type text followed by a slash and a space to begin conversion. Use space to
select a conversion candidate and Enter to commit it.
.PP
User dictionaries and command settings are stored in the mlh directory under
XDG_CONFIG_HOME, or ~/.config/mlh if XDG_CONFIG_HOME is not set.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B MLH_DICTIONARY
Path to an azooKey dictionary, overriding the installed dictionary.
.TP
.B MLH_TRANSLITERATOR
Set to google to use the Google transliteration API instead of azooKey.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ibus (1),
.BR mlh-gnome-terminal (1)
